      "content": "tiny changes doesnt really change anything though. it just feels like i'm decoratng my own cage. like i'm just waiting for the next time i fail so i can feel that same crushing weight again. it's just so heavy and i'm just so done with the effort of existing like this. does it ever actually get easier or is it just more of the same? maybe i was to win this. maybe it to just stop tugging at something",
